###############################################################################
# ReSound - .gitignore for a Kerbal Space Program config mod
###############################################################################

## Release archives
# Built by zipping GameData for a release. Regenerated on demand, so there is
# no reason to carry them in history where they would bloat every clone.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
Release/
Releases/
build/

## ModuleManager output
# Written next to GameData when the repository is symlinked or copied into a
# KSP install for testing. Machine local, rebuilt on every load, and a cache
# that follows a clone to another machine is worse than no cache at all.
ModuleManager.ConfigCache
ModuleManager.ConfigSHA
ModuleManager.Physics
ModuleManager.TechTree
ModuleManagerUnusedNodes.cfg
PartDatabase.cfg

## Game logs and crash artefacts, wherever they land
KSP.log
Player.log
output_log.txt
*.log
crash_*/
error.log

###############################################################################
# Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# Masters and editor projects for the clips in GameData/ReSound/Sounds. The
# game only ever loads the encoded .ogg files, and the sources behind them are
# large and, in some cases, licensed for reference rather than redistribution.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
###############################################################################
*.wav
*.flac
*.aiff
*.aup
*.aup3
Sources/

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.sublime-workspace

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
